repository-code: "https://github.com/anomalyco/freshroute"
url: "https://freshroute.example"
abstract: >
  Modular multi-stage ML and optimization framework for surplus food
  redistribution in the Indian ambient cold-chain: Arrhenius shelf-life kinetics,
  spatial-temporal demand forecasting (LSTM/LightGBM), multi-objective Pareto
  matching (MILP/NSGA-II), and VRPTW routing (OR-Tools) across Punjab's
  Mandi-Langar network.
